<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bradesco initiated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bradesco initiated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Santander Investment on Wednesday said it started coverage of Brazilian bank Bradesco SA with a rating of market perform.</p>
<p>-- Analysts Vasco Moreno and Allison Kraver wrote in a report that they expected earnings to rise to 0.86 real per share in 1996, 0.95 real in 1997 and 1.04 reais in 1998. Bradesco reported earnings of 0.58 real per share in 1995.</p>
<p>-- The 12-month to 18-month target price of 9.74 reais implies an 18.8 percent increase from the current level.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were off 0.10 to 7.85 in Sao Paulo on Wednesday.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
